        },
        "text": "Table of ContentsAlphabet Inc.",
        "text_hash": "2f8c99ac0bba90fcf6bfbc211cf5f2a488da9b5f380b95023f9e4d2c09546ec6",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000498-79716ffe",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[533]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 498,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In 2025, we entered into definitive agreements to acquire Wiz, a leading cloud security platform, for $32.0 billion, and Intersect, a provider of data center and energy infrastructure solutions, for $4.8 billion in cash plus the assumption of debt. Both acquisitions are expected to close in 2026, subject to customary closing conditions, including the receipt of regulatory approvals.",
        "text_hash": "79716ffed067a9e08883ed720a10328473fa5af4f771196048d12df46eab5aa6",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000499-80b6a813",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[534]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 499,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In 2025, we issued senior unsecured notes for net proceeds of $37.3 billion, to be used for general corporate purposes.",
        "text_hash": "80b6a813aea7ba708ac4b93c2fcd04db4fdbcfc7628cb092499d3e57adb69c93",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000500-52647acf",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[535]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 500,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•OI&E of $29.8 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025 included net gains on equity securities of $24.1 billion, primarily related to unrealized gains on our non-marketable equity securities.",
        "text_hash": "52647acf3f6235886bf94edea5994f05c819cb20afb3b16170c8b70ec7c2135c",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000501-f5e53cd5",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[536]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 501,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Other Bets operating loss of $7.5 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025 included a $2.1 billion employee compensation charge recognized in the fourth quarter for Waymo, primarily reflected in research and development expenses, based on estimated stock valuation. In February 2026, Waymo announced an investment round of $16.0 billion, the significant majority of which was funded by Alphabet.",
        "text_hash": "f5e53cd5e84871d549881c599e76af72403f6331b926b068bffed7dd87d0178a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000502-db0825c7",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[537]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 502,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Changes to U.S. tax law enacted on July 4, 2025, allow, among other things, for immediate expensing of domestic research and experimentation costs and accelerated depreciation on eligible capital expenditures, the effects of which are included in operating cash flows for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
        "text_hash": "db0825c7ca7d0d92fb717fe6be5e39721a89d55d22c10b63c1b24236343da82b",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000503-40b21c94",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[538]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 503,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Repurchases of Class A and Class C shares were $6.5 billion and $38.9 billion, respectively, totaling $45.4 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
        "text_hash": "40b21c940953b6599f05534f28067e19862212a86ef22ef16fdcac3e81e30743",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000504-eaf7c6df",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[539]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 504,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Operating cash flow was $164.7 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
        "text_hash": "eaf7c6df651ba87f224f2520eeead8d49a589937746049eafbea538d14f75dbe",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000505-5620c090",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[540]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 505,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Capital expenditures, which primarily reflected investments in technical infrastructure, were $91.4 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
        "text_hash": "5620c09042e2ee9925317b36be590fb70e061686f0b6bc60dc111fd48fb55b6a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000506-3fa0acac",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[541]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 506,
        "reported_page": 33,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_94",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•As of December 31, 2025, we had 190,820 employees.",
        "text_hash": "3fa0acac03dfdc5231ab51c736ed5503a28066c016d96fb70c1836ff8b7c9cf4",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
    ],
